0,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: HorribleSubsScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:42.54,Title,,0,0,250,,An Unknown MamaDialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw that little rabbit...Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Genie!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.79,0:01:59.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you call for me, Master?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,That little rabbit... I'm gonna chop her up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Time to show you...Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:09.78,Main,,0,0,0,,what we can do!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Daifuku-sama! You're putting us in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you aiming at, Genie-san?Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Come this way!Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,How annoying!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Genie-uine Rage Split!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop! Daifuku-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:48.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That little...Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:53.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That rat! She stole another helm!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.91,Main,,0,0,0,,That crafty little rabbit!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She's jumping from ship to ship and is making them attack each other!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,She sure is something...Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:11.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! She's awesome, right?! She's like a little sister to me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,When the moon cycle and the weather are in their favor...Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,the Minks are quite strong.Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The moon cycle and the weather?Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm...Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:29.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It is said that when the Minks gaze at a full moon on a clear night...Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,their feral instincts are awakened from the depths of their memories.Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:39.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That white, beastly form is known as...Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The Moon Lion, Sulong!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:45.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Sulong?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Originally, the transformation made them lose their minds and attack everyone in sight...Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,so it was quite troublesome.Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,For both other people... and themselves.Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:04:00.43,Main,,0,0,0,,For themselves? What do you mean by that?Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If a Mink is unable to control it, they willl get exhausted after a single night...Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,and die.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.63,0:04:09.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:10.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Die?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:16.70,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's a double-edged sword... It's a combat technique that could cost them their life.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:23.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot-san... stealing the enemy helms is truly a genius strategy.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:31.09,Main,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, I will provide assistance until we are close enough to fight, too!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:32.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Provide assistance?Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:34.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Won't you fall into the sea?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me...Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:48.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! He can run on water...Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.57,0:04:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,because he's so light!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.01,0:04:58.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the securing of our escape route to the two of them, and keep moving forward at full speed!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.68,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm!Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Dodge to the left!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,To the right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:24.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Sluggie-gie!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Prometheus...Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus...Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros!Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama's acting strange!Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick. Yeah, I know!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:02.49,Main,,0,0,0,,She's getting skinnier and is having a hard time breathing!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.57,0:06:10.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Prometheus... Zeus...Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:15.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Napoleon! What happened to Zeus and Prometheus?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm calling them over now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been almost eight hours since she started having her Hunger Pangs!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,We've never had a problem stopping them before...Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:29.62,Main,,0,0,0,,and I've never seen Mama this hungry.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Even we have no idea what will happen to Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,She's truly an unknown monster now. Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Will she make it to Cacao Island?Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:49.31,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Brother Peros,Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,A report came in, saying that Pudding is currently transporting the cake this way on a ship!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:58.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?! She's our guardian angel!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:02.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a problem, Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that Pudding is coming with the cake...Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,but the ship is... Bege's, apparently...Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick? Did you say Bege?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:18.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is the cake that's going to save this country on that assassin's ship?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you don't know?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do now?! We can't trust that cake anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:29.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,Within the Territory - Bege's ShipDialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Black Leg?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I should be saying! Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I will absolutely not let you poison the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,This cake will definitely reach Big Mom's mouth, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:09.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, what kind of idiot wouldn't add in poison or explosives?Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,This is our opportunity to take out one of the Four Emperors!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how big of an opportunity this is right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:20.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! This is a battle with a cook's pride on the line!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere! The taste alone will take care of our enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:27.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Stop dreaming!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:32.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is a woman who has eaten tons of delicious snacks from around the world in her lifetime...Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,and you think you can make a cake that will surpass her greatest imagination?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:44.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! If that cake isn't good enough, then we're done for!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'll take you up on that bet!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if we do succeed, they won't let us leave alive!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:57.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't know Big Mom's history!Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, we will regret not killing her when we had the chance!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:18.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Father?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:23.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you make Father eat?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You should ask him.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:32.14,Main,,0,0,0,,This cream... it's so good that I could go to Heaven right now.Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! He's about to die from the deliciousness?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:38.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, thank goodness-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Bege...Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You're free to try and assassinate her if you want...Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:52.14,Main,,0,0,0,,but... you can do it after I have filled the stomach of my guest!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:57.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I will feed anyone who wants to eat! That is the job of a cook!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you collapsing?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege! It's been a while, but even I helped with this!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:13.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Believe in the power of sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn... It's like I've been hypnotized!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:25.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Maybe this cake will work on Big Mom, too...Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Okay...Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:32.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hurry up! Have you finished coating the cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a little more to go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon-sama! Two of the cooks have fallen to the sweet smell!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys! Get ahold of yourselves until it's finished!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:51.71,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Stay safe... Nami-san, I'm on my way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:57.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Within the Territory - At Sea - Prometheus and ZeusDialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Which way?Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:02.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel Napoleon's presence!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, Prometheus. You went back to eat the forest fire!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's the one that caused me so much harm, Zeus?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.93,0:11:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you let yourself be used by the enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:22.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We are special Homies that were born straight from Mama's soul.Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,The next time you betray Mama to eat, you won't be let off so easily!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... but... those thunderclouds were delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:34.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really listening to me?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:35.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't steer the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to be swept away!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Within the Territory - The SunnyDialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,A path opened up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We can break through the enemy line!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot is amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:54.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! We have to protect the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:55.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,No, they're coming back!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot-san, wonderful!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! That skeleton's running on the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop him in his tracks!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:25.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I must keep up with her, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:57.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to lose consciousness! I'll have to stop soon.Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:59.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How many ships are left?Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:01.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn that little rabbit!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Genie-uine Rage Split!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.49,Main,,0,0,0,,He-teia saved me the work!Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:09.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll get her this time!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Genie...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot-san!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Guillotine!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, brat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:53.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Pedro...Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:08.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Corpse!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:14.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though it was only a little bit of assistance... I put one of the ships over there to sleep!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You've already done enough. Let's go back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.39,0:14:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved me! Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our line.Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,How do you turn back to normal?Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If I block my eyes from seeing the moonlight...Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,using a hat or some sunglasses... or by simply closing my eyes...Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:43.47,Main,,0,0,0,,The moonlight from a full moon enhances our abilities!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That was truly beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot... Are you all right?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:55.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:59.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you! You helped us out of a big pinch!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We were surrounded by enemies and our ship was almost sunk!Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to help.Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I go into a room where there's no moonlight?Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! Leave it to us and get some rest!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:25.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Peros! Big Brother Daifuku can't fight anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,His fleet is drifting away!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:31.29,Main,,0,0,0,,How useless... Daifuku!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:37.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama... Are you really all right?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.34,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are...Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:46.31,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:49.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus! Prometheus!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama?! She looks like a different person...Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is she so light?! Is it because she's so hungry?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:11.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick. How long has it been since I saw Mama move so fast?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me the wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:25.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Transform into a sword!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:46.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:15.10,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:18.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What has she turned into?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is my wedding cake?Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand back, guys! Be prepared to abandon ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:37.84,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm so hungry.Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:49.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But nothing else can satisfy me.Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:58.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is the wedding cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No! The Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:04.91,Main,,0,0,0,,How are we going to chase off such a monster?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:12.19,Captions,,0,0,4,,Wheat Island - Flour TownDialogue: 0,0:18:13.41,0:18:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:38.01,Main,,0,0,1,,Mirrors are...Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:41.57,Captions,,0,0,1,,Wheat Island - Flour TownDialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,If this continues, all of the mirrors in this town will be gone!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect him to fight this long against Katakuri-sama in the Mirro-world...Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep getting reports on mirror-breakings from various islands.Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:53.36,Captions,,0,960,380,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's already 9:30 PM-soir.Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:19:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been almost 12 hours since the assault on the Tea Party!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:10.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone... Do you wanna know something interesting?Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! Their chance of survival will lower even more.Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:17.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Stussy-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,At the Tea Party, Linlin revealed...Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,the Tamate Box from the Ryugu Palace.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.55,Main,,0,0,0,,She got it...Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:30.64,Main,,0,0,0,,from Straw Hat Luffy, didn't she?Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:33.27,Main,,0,0,0,,So what?Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That Tamate Box...Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:39.36,Main,,0,0,0,,contained explosives.Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure-bon?Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:49.49,Captions,,0,1040,380,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:49.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... he's still so perfect and cool.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:54.37,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.37,0:19:57.01,Main,,0,0,0,,haven't you gotten a clear shot yet, sniper?Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:20:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been shooting at him without being noticed...Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:05.47,Main,,0,0,0,,but he's moving so fast!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:06.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez! You're useless!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.47,Main,,0,0,0,,So crappy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't take out Straw Hat soon, Big Brother Katakuri will bring him down.Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Whose head is going to be patted by Big Brother?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's Flampe-sama's!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought so!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I have 41 older brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:45.99,Main,,0,0,0,,And 40 of them voted in the Best Little Sister Awards.Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I won!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:51.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That means I'm everyone's favorite!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:01.73,Captions,,0,0,300,,36th Daughter of the Charlotte Family Charlotte Flampe Katakuri Fan Club President and Suicide Squad CaptainDialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to be the king of the little sisters!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,So cute!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:09.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to be Big Brother Katakuri's favorite!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,But he's an icon for all his 38 younger sisters!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.89,0:21:20.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Even all his younger brothers admire him. There are too many rivals!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,So I wanna help him now to earn some bonus points!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We know how you feel, Flampe-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We want Katakuri-sama to like us, too!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care about you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:40.19,Main,,0,0,0,,When we got here, he didn't seem like himself.Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:44.62,Main,,0,0,0,,But now he's as cool as always!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't stand to see him having a hard time against an enemy in the first place!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He has to be perfect at all times!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.53,0:21:59.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Or I'll be disappointed!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:02.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.24,0:22:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But he's not having a hard time now.Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just that the enemy's persistent!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.61,0:22:14.10,Main,,0,0,0,,He must've received mortal wounds dozens of times, but he keeps getting up.Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What a fool!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.01,0:22:26.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How laughable.Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.09,0:22:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hide it in here?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.34,0:23:02.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! There's no cake on this ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:13.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous... That can't be true!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:18.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Because my son told me that it's here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:24.84,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's not here, then I'll have to take my eldest son's life with my own hands!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:31.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Sh-She remembers!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.81,0:23:35.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you're lying to me...Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:39.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,you'll pay with your lifespan!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:46.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Just how conscious is she right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.21,0:23:51.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I thought I could get away with it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:24:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare call my son a liar!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.50,0:24:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Napoleon!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:13.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Cognac!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:15.91,Note,,0,0,0,,Cognac: Type of brandy named after the town of Cognac in France.Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you and cut you in half!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:17.21,Main,,0,0,0,,A big flaming sword!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.21,0:24:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No chance! Get away, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.46,0:24:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.35,0:24:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Shark Skin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Blade of Destruction!Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What in the world?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.54,0:24:41.15,Main,,0,0,0,,He stopped Cognac!Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.15,0:24:43.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.07,0:24:50.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think...Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.82,0:24:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,you can overpower me, you damn shark!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.17,0:25:03.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe-san!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.42,0:25:05.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.44,0:25:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is it?! Bring out the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.44,0:25:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starving to death!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.32,0:25:21.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:29.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Carrot is in that room!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want me to stop...Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.46,0:25:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.45,0:25:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me where it is!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.47,0:25:45.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.68,0:25:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The sail caught fire from Big Mom's head!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:25:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you hide...Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:26:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Run, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.05,0:26:05.27,Main,,0,0,0,,that massive cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:09.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Guard Point!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.88,0:26:15.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.05,0:26:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, well...Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.23,0:26:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Look what you've turned into! They're getting more and more exotic.Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely add you to my collection of strange beasts!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.53,0:26:31.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You little chubby raccoon!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.70,0:26:35.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not a raccoon! I'm a reindeer!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.90,0:26:43.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Once I get the wedding cake, both you and Soul King will belong to me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.31,0:26:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! The cake isn't here, and I'm not your plaything!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.21,0:26:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.76,0:26:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! If Mama sinks their ship, maybe my lie will go down with it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:27:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If the Straw Hats lose their ship, they'll basically be done for!Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:04.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship...!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.37,0:27:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship's burning!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:27.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.76,0:27:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Stamp! Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:43.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Did he try to dodge?Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.43,0:27:50.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Why won't the lights go out...Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:55.51,Main,,0,0,0,,in your...Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.26,0:27:58.51,Main,,0,0,0,,eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't understand you. Falling down to the ground is disgraceful.Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.08,0:29:01.69,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship...!Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.69,0:29:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship is is burning!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.11,0:29:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, where is the wedding cake?Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.53,0:29:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.54,0:29:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.47,0:29:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do? What should I do? We have to put out the fire!Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.55,0:29:22.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Water! Water!Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.85,0:29:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ocean Current...Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.80,0:29:33.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoulder Throw!Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:10.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.59,0:30:13.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! Suddenly, the water...!Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.81,0:30:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe-san!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.93,0:30:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Get off of this ship, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.47,0:30:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want...Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.85,0:30:37.94,Main,,0,0,0,,then hand over the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.98,0:30:42.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate Secret Technique!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.99,0:30:47.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Vagabond Drill!Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.04,0:31:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.14,0:31:19.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.07,0:31:24.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! He kicked her out!Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.21,0:31:26.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, you're amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.07,0:31:28.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.20,0:31:29.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it!Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.33,0:31:33.63,Main,,0,0,0,,If we allow them to damage the ship any further...Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.63,0:31:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,how will we face Luffy and the others?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.23,0:31:38.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship cannot slow down!Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:43.01,Main,,0,0,0,,If Perospero and the others catch up to us, that'll be the end of the line!Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.01,0:31:43.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.65,0:31:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.54,0:31:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on us!Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.63,0:31:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but...Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.38,0:31:53.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom will regain her footing right away!Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.89,0:31:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,How's Carrot?Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.04,0:31:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,She's okay!Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.31,0:32:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's lose them at full speed!Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.65,0:32:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.02,0:32:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.20,0:32:18.62,Main,,0,0,0,,That wasn't so bad, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.33,0:32:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.41,0:32:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! I have an idea!Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.51,0:32:29.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's slice it up!Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.43,0:32:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'm sure I'll find it!Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.52,0:32:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,The wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.77,0:32:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,It stretched this time! If she swings that sword around...Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.40,0:32:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship will be finished!Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.64,0:32:48.73,Main,,0,0,0,,At least Big Mom isn't on the ship anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.73,0:32:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, Zeus-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.37,0:32:53.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You like these, right?Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.28,0:32:56.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are...!Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.20,0:32:58.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Black Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.25,0:33:06.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's delicious! It's delicious! So delicious!!Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.59,0:33:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Yum-yum!Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.01,0:33:14.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Now, help yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.13,0:33:16.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.58,0:33:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Humph! The same trick won't work twice!Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.02,0:33:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't try to fool me, you temptress!Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.35,0:33:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.28,0:33:35.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.84,0:33:37.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.75,0:33:48.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right... I don't have any flesh, so lightning doesn't affect me.Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.16,0:33:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.34,0:33:55.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna fight me again, Soul King?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.47,0:34:01.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember that you couldn't even scratch me with your sword before!Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.24,0:34:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right... So may I at least...Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.84,0:34:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,see your panties?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.55,0:34:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.76,0:34:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.61,0:34:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's done!Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Three-Pace Hum...Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.57,0:34:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Soul...Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.52,0:34:40.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Notch Slash!Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.68,0:34:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,From the very beginning, our target was you alone, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.59,0:34:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! Damn! I let my guard down!Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.93,0:34:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.39,0:35:01.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Positive Charge Black Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.31,0:35:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Discharge and feel better, Zeus-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.48,0:35:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You...!Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.03,0:35:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This is...Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:14.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.88,0:35:30.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.85,0:35:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.67,0:35:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus discharged!Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.90,0:35:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.82,0:35:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We did it!Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.12,0:35:46.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We bought some time! Let's make some headway now!Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.84,0:35:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.55,0:35:49.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.87,0:35:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Grab this!Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.34,0:36:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm back!Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.14,0:36:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! Welcome back!Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.29,0:36:05.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook, well done!Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.60,0:36:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We tried to minimize the damage, but it's quite bad.Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.06,0:36:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.82,0:36:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I brought something back.Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:20.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:23.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Isn't he dangerous?Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.20,0:36:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think he has much energy left...Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.90,0:36:30.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, where am I?Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.95,0:36:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you again, Zeus.Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.82,0:36:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice... to... see you... too...Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.79,0:36:45.23,Main,,0,0,0,,As I recall, you tried to...Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,strike me with lightning earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:50.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:55.39,Main,,0,0,0,,If "sorry" were enough, there would be no need for sheriffs or the Navy.Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet you got the wrong idea earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.27,0:37:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to be my friend...Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.28,0:37:09.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.14,0:37:11.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you one more time...Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:15.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you be my servant... or would you rather...Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.10,0:37:18.37,Main,,0,0,0,,die?Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.58,0:37:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about it carefully.Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.21,0:37:30.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.81,0:37:33.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up...Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.72,0:37:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.59,0:37:39.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Chase them, Prometheus!Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.93,0:37:41.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.35,0:37:46.10,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll  Flampe Age Fix: KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.52,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WDialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:07.40,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,We'veDialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:07.54,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gotDialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:07.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,SuDialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,